            <note corresp="#d702-f2" n="12" xml:id="d702-f2-content">
                <p>Harry L. Hopkins, Special Assistant to President Roosevelt, was not at the Quebec
                    Conference, but he sent the memorandum from Washington to President Roosevelt at
                    Quebec.</p>
            </note>
